M106 S100                ; fan on while the bed heats
G0 Z40 F10000
M190 S60.0         ; wait for bed temp
M107                     ; fan off
;--- Bed Levelling ---
M84 E                    ; turn off E motor
G29 P1                   ; invalidate mbl & probe print area
